<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">This Press Release contains certain statements that are &ldquo;forward-looking
statements&rdquo; within the meaning of Section&nbsp;27A of the&nbsp;Securities Act&nbsp;and Section&nbsp;21E of the&nbsp;Exchange Act.
Amcor has identified some of these forward-looking statements with words like &ldquo;believe,&rdquo; &ldquo;target,&rdquo; &ldquo;project,&rdquo;
